{"version":1,"content":"<p>音樂人郭偉亮（Eric Kwok）伙《中年好聲音3》歌手占士丁丁（Dan James），組成電音DJ組合「HOHO ONE」，去年正式拍檔，轉眼已踏足美國、韓國及杜拜等電音舞台。</p><p>Eric直呼整段經歷超現實：「我哋上年先開始學做DJ，所以真係好癲！</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.319317+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:20:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T00:58:20.242083+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.351660+00:00","content_hash":"03659f791281bb4de521600eb2c6be76a51799e629ba3ffd861f9ccd3c78ff54","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}